@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.iuml
title Detailed model - configured domain and recorded facts
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 65
class "Organization Policy" as Policy {
  excludedExtensions : Extension [0..*]
}
class "Downloads Folder" as Folder {
  location : FolderLocation
}
class "Category Rule" as Rule {
  categoryFolderName : Text
  matchingExtensions : Extension [0..*]
  reviewAfterDays : Integer
}
class Category {
  name : CategoryName
}
class "Review Area" as Review {
  name : Text = "Expiring Files"
  /location : FolderLocation
}
class "Downloaded File" as File {
  /name : Text
  originalLocation : FileLocation
  recordedLocation : FileLocation
  firstOrganizedAt : Instant [0..1]
  lifecycle : FileLifecycle [0..1]
  expectedContent : Fingerprint [0..1]
  snoozedUntil : Instant [0..1]
}
class Preview <<transient>> {
  policyAtPreview : PolicyValues
}
class "Organization Proposal" as Proposal <<transient>> {
  sourceLocation : FileLocation
  proposedDestination : FileLocation
  observedContent : Fingerprint
}
class Operation {
  kind : OperationKind
  status : OperationStatus
  recordedAt : Instant
  sourceLocation : FileLocation
  destinationLocation : FileLocation [0..1]
  outcomeNote : Text [0..1]
}
class "File Condition" as Condition <<value>> {
  phase : ConditionPhase
  location : FileLocation
  category : CategoryName
  lifecycle : FileLifecycle
  firstOrganizedAt : Instant
  expectedContent : Fingerprint
  snoozedUntil : Instant [0..1]
}
Policy "0..1" -- "1" Folder : selects
Policy "1" *-- "6" Rule : configures
Rule "1" -- "1" Category : defines treatment for
Folder "1" -- "1" Review : designates
Folder "1" -- "0..*" File : discovery context of
Category "0..1" -- "0..*" File : recorded classification of
Policy "1" -- "0..1" Preview : current matching preview
Preview "1" *-- "0..*" Proposal : presents
Proposal "0..1" -- "1" File : concerns
Proposal "0..*" -- "1" Category : proposes
File "1" -- "0..*" Operation : subject of
Operation "0..*" --> "0..1" Operation : attempts to undo
Operation "1" *-- "1..2" Condition : records conditions
note bottom of Condition
  Immutable historical values, not a second file.
  Intended facts do not prove an action completed.
  Exactly one IntendedAfter; at most one Before.
  Before is absent for initial organization.
end note
note bottom of Review
  A designated place, not a deletion deadline.
  The physical folder is created on demand.
end note
legend bottom
  Multiplicities describe one configured profile and its retained file history.
  / = derived value. [0..1] = optional. No methods or database keys are modeled.
  Lifecycle and expected content are absent before tracking; see the text for value domains.
endlegend
@enduml
